    "chunk_text": "swa pipor is & Gif of hatum w\u00e6tan yfelum on \u00feone magon gesamnodum se geohsa cume & he gefele \u00fe\u00e6t se hine Wi\u00fe wl\u00e6ttan, \u00feam men \u00fee hine ne lyst his metes ne li\u00fees o\u00f0\u00f0e on magan untrum sie o\u00fe\u00fee bitere Eft wi\u00fe wlatunge, rudan, wermod, bisceopwyrt, marubian, wyl on eala\u00f0 swi\u00fee geswet mid hunige Wi\u00fe sculdor w\u00e6rce, ealdes swines tord \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee feldgangende sie meng wi\u00f0 ealdne rysele, gewyrme, \u00de\u00e6t deah wi\u00fe sculdor w\u00e6rce ge wi\u00f0 sid w\u00e6rce, wi\u00f0 breost w\u00e6rce & wi\u00fe lendenw\u00e6rce. Eft wyl betonican & neftan on ealo\u00f0, sele drincan gelome & simle \u00e6t fyre gesmire mid wenwyrte. Eft genim swines scearn \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee on dun lande & wyrtum libbe, m\u00e6ng wi\u00fe ealdne rysele, lege on & Gif fefer habbe drince on w\u00e6tere. Wi\u00fe sidan sare \u00fe\u00e6re swi\u00feran, bogen & redic & hwite cl\u00e6fran wyrc to clame & to drence. Wi\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6re winestran sidan sare, wudurifan gecnuwa on eced & wyrc to clame, gebind on \u00fea sidan. Eft betonican swilc swa \u00fery penegas gewegen & pipores seofon & XX corna tosomne getrifulad, Eft wi\u00f0 sidan sare, rudan wi\u00f0 rysele gemenged & gebeaten lecge on \u00fea sidan, \u00fe\u00e6t bet. Wi\u00fe sidan sare eft, laures croppan gebeate, drince on w\u00e6tere",
